  "notes": "The bubble releases flat and stays behind the line the whole time the ball is in the air; the tight end attached on his side and the receiver outside him stalk-block the overhang and the corner. Authored to exercise the behind-the-LOS coverage rule and the yards-after-catch handoff on a throw that is out at Moment 0. Authored with ten men and a receiver in the tight end's Y slot until \u00a7175.2.",
